markedup_text = "Set it to guard the lumber yard."
outcome = SubResource("Resource_wy5a4")
markedup_result_text = "The woman asks the dog to stand guard outside of the lumber yard, showering it with praise at the end of each day.

The dog seems excited to remain useful despite its advanced age."

